I am in my room.
My suitcase is big.
I open the suitcase.
I take my clothes out.
There is a photo in the suitcase.
It is in a frame.
It is a photo of my family.
My parents are in the photo.
This is my younger sister.
Her name is Sofia.
This is my elder brother.
His name is Diego.
Our dog Lola is also in the photo.
I place that photo on the table.
Now this room feels a little like mine.
I smile.
